{"id":"00398","root":"uni00398_1","name":{"ja":"ナーサラ","en":"Nasara"},"title":{"ja":"【フラフラ娘】","en":"【Wandering Girl】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【フラフラ娘】 ナーサラ","en":"【Wandering Girl】 Nasara"},"aliases":["Narsala"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2020-11-16","limited":false,"characterId":8,"profile":{"ja":"魔界に突如現れた知的生命体。何かのはずみで生み出され、それ以来魔界をあてもなく徘徊している。本能に従い、他の物質や生物を取りこんでいく。本能的に新たな物や知識を取り込むようになっており、一度取り込んだ種類の者や物は取り込まない。女の形を形成しているのも、知識を取りこむために有用だからであり、本来さまざまな形に変化出来る。生物的な感情はほとんどなく、ただ無造作に作業をするのみ。ただし敵意を向けられると、その相手を破壊するまで攻撃を繰り返す。元々魔界の住人ではなく、別次元から何者かによって転移された生物。だが、送り主の思惑から外れて勝手に動き回る中で独自の進化をとげ、現在は人間界を散策しながらあらゆることを学習しようとしている。","en":"She is an intelligent lifeform that suddenly appeared in the Demon Realm. Created by some unknown catalyst, she has been wandering the Demon Realm aimlessly ever since. Acting on instinct, she assimilates other substances and organisms, but never repeats a type she has already absorbed. Her instinct drives her to constantly acquire new matter and knowledge, which is why she has taken on a female form—it proves useful for gathering information. Though she appears human, she can shift into many shapes. She possesses little biological emotion and merely performs tasks indiscriminately, yet she will retaliate violently if she is attacked, repeatedly destroying her foe. Consequently, she does not act hostile unless someone is an enemy or prey."},"illustrator":"SASAYUKi","voiceActor":"三十三七","forms":[{"id":"uni00398_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1230,2460],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[191,382],"def":[124,248],"spd":[68,68],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","840007"]},{"id":"uni00398_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1860,3720],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[307,614],"def":[173,346],"spd":[68,68],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["3","840007","840008"]},{"id":"uni00398_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2490,5007],"sp":[33